cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the repository and the relevant technical report."
title: "factorlab and latticelab: certified computations for covering floors in deterministic factoring and conditional profile optima in lattice reduction"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ward
    given-names: Sean
    affiliation: iGent AI
  - name: Maestro
    affiliation: iGent AI
version: "2026.09"
date-released: 2026-09-02
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/iGentAI/factorlab"
abstract: >-
  Research harness (factorlab, latticelab), tests and archived results behind two technical reports: Floors for deterministic
  integer factoring (covering models, partial information, the additive structure of the Lehman-Harvey start set, the common-factor
  class, fixed-list ECM exposure labels, NFS polynomial selection) and Certified conditional profile optima for block lattice
  reduction, with the ML-KEM detection chain. Every measured or certified statement in the reports is regenerable from this
  repository.
references:
